Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.78,0:00:08.03,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Arise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.24,0:00:23.40,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.14,0:01:57.06,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,How long has it been?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.06,0:01:58.81,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,About three hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.27,0:02:02.52,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,That's roughly three days \Non the other side, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.98,0:02:05.90,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,It's supposed to be particularly \Nharsh inside of a red gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.32,0:02:11.07,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,Then that Sung Jinwoo guy is probably dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.53,0:02:13.10,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,What a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.33,0:02:21.04,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,No... Hang on. Sung Jinwoo isn't \Nwith the White Tiger Guild, is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.54,0:02:26.48,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,Then why exactly is he with your strike team?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.96,0:02:31.30,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,He's an acquaintance of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.30,0:02:34.97,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,He wanted to observe a C-Rank raid, \Nso I brought him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.68,0:02:38.39,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,Oh, is that all?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.48,0:02:44.86,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,You really think I'm that gullible?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.86,0:02:47.78,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,What have you dug up this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.78,0:02:51.90,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,You've always had a knack for \Nsniffing out where interesting new—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.49,0:02:54.57,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,Hwang Dongsoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.71,0:02:57.54,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,Take your hands off him!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.88,0:02:59.91,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,You really wanna start giving me orders?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.91,0:03:03.54,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,You think you're a big fish \Nin this tiny pond of a country?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.16,0:03:05.43,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,Say that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.56,0:03:10.13,DefaultItalics,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,This isn't good!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.13,0:03:14.38,DefaultItalics,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,If they're not stopped soon, \Nwe'll have an S-Rank battle on our hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.72,0:03:16.40,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,You want some?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.13,0:03:34.99,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,It was too cold... No...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.64,0:03:38.95,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,If we had our gear, we could've won...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.95,0:03:43.87,DefaultItalics,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,I thought it was strange none \Nof the ice bears had come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.48,0:03:47.08,DefaultItalics,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,It can't be... Did those E-Ranks do this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.82,0:03:50.67,DefaultItalics,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,No way! They couldn't be strong enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.13,0:03:55.59,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,Wait, the Ice Slayers...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.59,0:03:56.51,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,They're here, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.93,0:03:58.14,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.64,0:04:05.23,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,Not too shabby.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.23,0:04:13.37,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,Thanks to you both holding back at the \Nlast second, my arms remain intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.92,0:04:19.33,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,I'm not sure what your interest \Nis in him, Hunter Hwang,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.33,0:04:23.91,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,but I personally re-evaluated him \Ntwo months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.54,0:04:27.88,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,I can guarantee you \Nthat Hunter Sung is E-Rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.23,0:04:32.32,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,The Surveillance Team has declared \NHunter Hwang Dongsuk's cause of death
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.32,0:04:34.37,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,as being KIA in battle against a magic beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.38,0:04:38.34,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,That's just the story for the public, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.34,0:04:40.68,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,And an obviously fake one, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.68,0:04:44.80,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,The real killer's gotta be that rich \Nlittle turd from Yoojin Construction.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.19,0:04:49.56,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,If you think that, then why \Nare you after Hunter Sung?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.85,0:04:52.84,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,Ain't it obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.84,0:04:55.11,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,It's just an excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.57,0:04:57.57,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,An excuse to kill the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.52,0:05:06.34,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,He's a lucky bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.04,0:05:10.36,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,Hunter Hwang!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.83,0:05:15.18,DefaultItalics,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,Nobody understands \NHunter Sung's power like I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.87,0:05:18.21,DefaultItalics,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,I know for a fact that \Nhe will survive, and return.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.89,0:05:23.89,Default,Go Myunghwan,0,0,0,,And so, then I was out of money to buy gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.67,0:05:27.85,Default,Go Myunghwan,0,0,0,,I'm telling you! I was off by a factor of ten!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.85,0:05:29.81,DefaultTop,Go Myunghwan,0,0,0,,It was that expensive!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.56,0:05:33.04,DefaultItalics,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,What the hell are weaklings \Nlike you doing alive?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.81,0:05:31.55,DefaultTop,Park Heejin,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.04,0:05:35.67,DefaultTop,Go Myunghwan,0,0,0,,So much that I had to take \Nall of the weapons and—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.04,0:05:36.28,DefaultItalics,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,You've got cold-weather gear, \Nblankets, tents, and even food!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.39,0:05:40.49,DefaultItalics,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,Oh, is that what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.31,0:05:42.62,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.53,0:05:44.92,Default,Park Heejin,0,0,0,,Hunter Kim?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.92,0:05:47.37,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,My entire strike team was wiped out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.00,0:05:50.46,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,Because they didn't have gear and supplies!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.46,0:05:51.64,Default,Go Myunghwan,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.64,0:05:53.71,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,Who hid all of this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.71,0:05:57.59,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,Who was the one that hoarded all this \Nequipment and got my friends killed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.42,0:06:00.65,DefaultItalics,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.65,0:06:01.92,Default,Han Song-yi,0,0,0,,H-Heejin...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.92,0:06:04.51,DefaultItalics,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,You knew all along, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.51,0:06:06.47,DefaultItalics,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,That's why you went with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.82,0:06:09.67,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,Any collaborators will be \Nconsidered guilty, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.17,0:06:12.40,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,I want a confession by the count of three!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.30,0:06:14.86,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,One!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.25,0:06:16.12,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.12,0:06:17.82,DefaultItalics,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,I know who did it...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.73,0:06:19.84,DefaultItalics,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,Sung Jinwoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.84,0:06:21.19,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.93,0:06:31.61,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,You're blaming your friends' \Ndeath on who, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.61,0:06:32.62,Default,Han Song-Yi,0,0,0,,Mister!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.62,0:06:34.02,Default,Go Myunghwan,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.02,0:06:36.57,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,And you dragged in a bunch of extra trouble...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.95,0:06:41.67,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Drop the Stealth. Your aura's way \Ntoo strong to not notice, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.52,0:06:45.93,Default,Park Heejin,0,0,0,,Are those ice elves?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.93,0:06:47.77,Default,Go Myunghwan,0,0,0,,And so many of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.70,0:06:49.98,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That guy must be the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.59,0:06:56.48,Default,Barca,0,0,0,,Imagine my surprise...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.83,0:06:59.18,Default,Barca,0,0,0,,Finding out that some of you scum \Nknow what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.53,0:07:00.93,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.93,0:07:04.46,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Are you calling us scum when...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.39,0:07:11.44,Default,Barca,0,0,0,,...You actually understand our language?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.58,0:07:13.78,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Actually... Why do I?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.78,0:07:17.08,Default,Park Heejin,0,0,0,,You can speak the magic beasts' language?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.54,0:07:19.57,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I guess I can thank the system for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.92,0:07:22.93,Default,Barca,0,0,0,,If you can understand me, \Nthen I'll make this simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.93,0:07:25.14,Default,Barca,0,0,0,,My friend here has informed me...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.10,0:07:29.54,Default,Barca,0,0,0,,that one of the humans \Nwe've encountered is strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.54,0:07:31.93,Default,Barca,0,0,0,,He also wants to fight you—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.19,0:07:40.09,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,And?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.79,0:07:44.39,Default,Barca,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.67,0:07:52.91,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,He's not gonna go down easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.95,0:07:56.04,Default,Barca,0,0,0,,This keeps getting better.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.48,0:08:02.55,Default,Barca,0,0,0,,Tell me, you're not human, \Nso why are you pretending to be one?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.80,0:08:08.47,Default,Barca,0,0,0,,Oh, I suppose you aren't aware?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.47,0:08:13.17,Default,Barca,0,0,0,,We can hear a voice. \NIt tells us to kill humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.17,0:08:16.44,Default,Barca,0,0,0,,But we don't hear it when it comes to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.82,0:08:18.49,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,A voice...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.33,0:08:22.19,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Could it be similar to the system directives?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.19,0:08:27.45,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The voice not directing them against me \Ncould stem from me being the Player.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.45,0:08:32.86,Default,Barca,0,0,0,,There's no need for us to fight. \NLet's handle this the sensible way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.86,0:08:37.85,Default,Barca,0,0,0,,Hand over those humans behind you, \Nand we'll leave you alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.85,0:08:40.91,Default,Barca,0,0,0,,How about it? What do you say to our offer?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.63,0:08:43.71,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Who exactly are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.05,0:08:46.25,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Why are you fighting humans, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.72,0:08:48.29,Default,Barca,0,0,0,,We are—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.24,0:08:56.48,Default,Barca,0,0,0,,Hand over those humans behind you, \Nand we'll leave you alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.99,0:08:58.58,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,What was that just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.58,0:09:01.57,Default,Barca,0,0,0,,How about it? What do you say to our offer?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.57,0:09:03.40,Default,Barca,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.36,0:09:07.40,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,No, I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.80,0:09:11.91,Default,Barca,0,0,0,,You intend on making enemies of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.91,0:09:15.15,Default,Barca,0,0,0,,As you can see, the numbers are on our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.33,0:09:17.75,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Are you sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.92,0:09:27.55,Default,Han Song-Yi,0,0,0,,Wh-What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.55,0:09:30.30,Default,Go Myunghwan,0,0,0,,M-Monsters! A bunch of monsters just appeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.30,0:09:33.68,Default,Park Heejin,0,0,0,,Black soldiers and black ice bears?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.68,0:09:34.79,Default,Park Heejin,0,0,0,,Are these all...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.79,0:09:36.98,Default,Park Heejin,0,0,0,,Hunter Sung, did you do this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.75,0:09:40.25,Default,Barca,0,0,0,,What a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.25,0:09:43.53,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,A waste? You really think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.53,0:10:04.51,Default,Park Heejin,0,0,0,,Hurry! We won't be any help \Nin a fight like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.43,0:10:14.41,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I can see why he was so confident.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.81,0:10:18.00,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,My summons might be immortal, but \Ntheir regeneration costs magic power.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.98,0:10:21.27,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I have a lot, but it'll run out eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.77,0:10:23.15,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Then there's the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.72,0:10:25.61,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,He's pretty clearly stronger than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.50,0:10:35.33,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Even if I fought alongside Igris, \Nit'd probably be tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.00,0:10:37.95,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Regular soldiers aren't going to cut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.72,0:10:41.37,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I need a stronger fighting force.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.37,0:10:43.33,Default,Barca,0,0,0,,My name is Barca.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.81,0:10:45.67,Default,Barca,0,0,0,,What's yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.80,0:10:49.12,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Sung Jinwoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.31,0:11:18.49,Default,Barca,0,0,0,,I haven't enjoyed a fight like this in ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.40,0:11:35.43,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,What hit me...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.19,0:11:42.43,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,Sung Jinwoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.03,0:11:47.74,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I was able to buy some time \Nwith the magic soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.23,0:11:49.10,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That just leaves...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.75,0:11:52.47,Default,Barca,0,0,0,,Is that the best your men can do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.11,0:11:56.45,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,Sung Jinwoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.45,0:11:58.08,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.08,0:12:00.39,Default,Barca,0,0,0,,The humans have abandoned you, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.16,0:12:10.38,Default,Barca,0,0,0,,Worthless! Hiding won't save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.10,0:12:20.39,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,Sung Jinwoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.39,0:12:22.05,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.05,0:12:25.29,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Kim Chul. I figured that was your next move.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.68,0:12:31.69,Default,Barca,0,0,0,,Worthless!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.25,0:12:38.70,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,Sung Jinwoo... You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.72,0:12:45.12,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,You knew... this would happen...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.46,0:12:47.15,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,Damn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.34,0:12:50.09,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Arise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.00,0:12:55.63,Default,Barca,0,0,0,,Hiding won't save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.25,0:13:11.23,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.93,0:13:14.84,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,From now on, your name is Iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.60,0:13:24.95,Default,Barca,0,0,0,,Isn't that interesting?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.95,0:13:27.23,Default,Barca,0,0,0,,I'll cut you to pieces first!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.23,0:13:38.12,Default,Barca,0,0,0,,Not very agile, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.46,0:13:46.87,Default,Han Song-Yi,0,0,0,,Heejin, are hunter battles always like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.30,0:13:51.06,Default,Park Heejin,0,0,0,,Do you really think I could \Nbe a hunter if they were?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.46,0:13:53.50,Default,Park Heejin,0,0,0,,I've never seen anything like this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.50,0:13:56.23,Default,Go Myunghwan,0,0,0,,This is really happening, isn't it...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.34,0:14:01.91,Default,Barca,0,0,0,,This one isn't satisfying enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.28,0:14:07.05,Default,Barca,0,0,0,,You and the knight need to face me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.05,0:14:08.54,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.18,0:14:23.68,Default,Barca,0,0,0,,You get to die first!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.40,0:14:35.77,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,He was able to avoid a \Nfatal hit amidst all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.39,0:14:40.89,Default,Barca,0,0,0,,You're taking me too lightly, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.89,0:14:42.82,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,You're definitely strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.33,0:14:46.37,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,But what about your soldiers?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.72,0:14:58.34,Default,Barca,0,0,0,,I doubt your rabble will \Namount to much without you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.10,0:15:02.73,Default,Barca,0,0,0,,Throwing away your weapon?! Fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.14,0:15:12.98,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Iron!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.22,0:15:35.50,Default,Barca,0,0,0,,How dare you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.03,0:15:39.61,Default,Barca,0,0,0,,I'll slaughter you all!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.26,0:15:43.43,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It's already over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.43,0:15:48.20,Default,Barca,0,0,0,,Don't give me that! \NIt's over when I say it's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.53,0:15:59.65,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Like I said...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.02,0:16:04.06,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It's already over.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.52,0:16:10.42,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Looks like I managed to beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.67,0:16:17.54,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Hey! Enough already!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.13,0:16:21.00,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Show some restraint.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.92,0:16:24.92,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I hope this doesn't become a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.09,0:16:39.87,Default,Park Heejin,0,0,0,,Is it over?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.87,0:16:41.02,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.07,0:16:44.64,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,We should get going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.50,0:16:50.11,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Back out of the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.31,0:16:55.91,Default,Go Myunghwan,0,0,0,,Yes! We get to go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.91,0:16:57.73,Default,Unmarked AD,0,0,0,,What a relief...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.73,0:16:59.01,Default,Unmarked AD,0,0,0,,It felt like forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.01,0:17:00.45,Default,Unmarked AD,0,0,0,,Finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.06,0:17:03.53,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,But first...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.60,0:17:11.97,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,At this point, I believe it's \Nbeen a week inside the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.97,0:17:16.37,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,The rest of us can stay on standby. \NYou should head home, President.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.93,0:17:20.77,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,I'm not going to do that when \Nwe've got guild members inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.77,0:17:22.49,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,I'll wait until morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.75,0:17:26.90,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,Those are people... They're coming out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.97,0:17:29.36,DefaultItalics,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,Hunter Kim!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.74,0:17:32.35,DefaultItalics,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,I knew you could pull it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.83,0:17:34.83,Default,Park Heejin,0,0,0,,President Baek!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.29,0:17:41.50,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,Hunter Park... Hunter Go. \NI'm glad to see you two are all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.89,0:17:43.44,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,What about the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.26,0:17:53.66,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,Hunter Sung!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.48,0:17:56.06,DefaultItalics,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.03,0:18:03.23,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,The gate... closed?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.84,0:18:06.62,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,Where are the others? Where's Hunter Kim?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.03,0:18:08.19,Default,Park Heejin,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.24,0:18:12.17,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,The lower ranks are \Nthe only ones who returned?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.17,0:18:14.62,DefaultItalics,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,What in the world went on in there...?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.62,0:18:16.94,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Let's go. I'll drive you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.94,0:18:18.66,Default,Han Song-yi,0,0,0,,Oh, r-right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.66,0:18:19.94,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,Hang on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.94,0:18:22.31,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,I'd like to ask you some questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.19,0:18:25.36,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'm exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.36,0:18:27.69,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Save the questions \Nfor someone from your guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.34,0:18:33.49,DefaultItalics,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,That wasn't me asking for a favor. \NIt was an order, or failing that, a threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.23,0:18:38.81,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,Six members of my guild have gone missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.15,0:18:43.48,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,And it falls to me to find out \Nwhat happened to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.84,0:18:49.83,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That might be true, but I saved \Nthe two surviving members.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.83,0:18:54.02,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,So doesn't it fall to you \Nto show me the proper gratitude first?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.05,0:19:03.62,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,You'll have to excuse me. \NYou are absolutely right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.60,0:19:06.45,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.24,0:19:11.62,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,Hunter Park...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.62,0:19:12.68,Default,Park Heejin,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.68,0:19:17.28,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,Who in the world was that? \NNot exactly friendly, is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.28,0:19:22.60,Default,Park Heejin,0,0,0,,Well... After he beat the boss, \Nhis mood turned sour all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.60,0:19:26.36,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,Most likely from exhaustion.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.36,0:19:28.28,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,He's not a bad guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.54,0:19:31.82,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,Manager Ahn...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.82,0:19:35.91,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,You need to bring him to our guild, \Nno matter what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.91,0:19:37.28,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.35,0:19:42.52,DefaultItalics,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,Looks like I was right all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.59,0:19:46.71,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Good work today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.71,0:19:48.09,Default,Han Song-yi,0,0,0,,Have a safe trip home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.17,0:19:52.21,Default,Han Song-yi,0,0,0,,Um... Jinwoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.04,0:19:54.13,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Just "Jinwoo"?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.13,0:19:56.78,Default,Han Song-yi,0,0,0,,Thank you for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.45,0:20:02.10,Default,Han Song-yi,0,0,0,,I'll be counting on you tomorrow... \Nor whenever the next time is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.94,0:20:06.23,Default,Song Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.84,0:20:12.92,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, it hasn't \Neven been a whole day out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.88,0:20:17.18,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,This was the only thing of note \NI managed to earn.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.49,0:20:21.48,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,He must've been too high a level...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.88,0:20:32.59,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I wasn't able to extract him, \Neven after three tries.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.75,0:20:31.83,FlashbackTop,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.43,0:20:36.80,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,A lot of effort for not much gain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.75,0:20:39.01,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Although...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.64,0:20:47.65,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That's the third time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.67,0:20:55.16,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,Jinwoo? I'm gonna eat without you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.16,0:20:56.81,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'm on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.94,0:21:00.74,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.89,0:21:03.91,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,You're wearing... that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.91,0:21:06.45,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Yep! Let's get moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.83,0:21:09.42,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.42,0:21:11.60,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,We'll be picking someone up along the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.32,0:21:16.47,Default,Han Song-yi,0,0,0,,Good morning, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.47,0:21:19.04,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Oh... Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.04,0:21:21.82,Default,Han Song-yi,0,0,0,,Sorry about needing to get \Npicked up like this, Jinwoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.85,0:21:23.85,DefaultItalics,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Just Jinwoo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.45,0:21:26.14,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Did you get any sleep after all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.14,0:21:28.09,Default,Han Song-yi,0,0,0,,Not even a little!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.09,0:21:30.69,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Well, considering how late it was \Nwhen you got home...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.10,0:21:32.52,DefaultItalics,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,She got home in the morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.71,0:21:32.52,DefaultTop,Han Song-yi,0,0,0,,Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.52,0:21:34.19,DefaultTop,Han Song-yi,0,0,0,,Jinwoo, did you—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.52,0:21:34.19,DefaultItalics,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,and didn't sleep at all?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.19,0:21:37.28,DefaultItalics,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Is that what's going on here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.78,0:21:39.77,DefaultTop,Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Get some sleep now. \NI'll let you know when it's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.72,0:21:41.31,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Uh, Boss...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.77,0:21:41.31,DefaultTop,Han Song-yi,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.10,0:21:45.45,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,You know that Miss Han... is underage, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.54,0:21:47.58,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,And?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.09,0:21:54.91,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Nothing. Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.09,0:21:58.98,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Let's get to work so we can finish fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.98,0:22:00.51,Default,Han Song-yi,0,0,0,,Right, Jinwoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.93,0:22:02.26,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Right...
